    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71a41f99f534deabbd50b71d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太好了！那么，我现在就去了。\n如果有什么在意的地方，请一定要马上说出来，那就！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c70c3dc27ef53e17683bd2170edb13589b3f627c3edae5112ee838867bb331",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6254eac2d3fc65e0c70369f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话刚说完，成田路就跑着离开了。\n见到她那种气势，我不由得露出笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0887b092b386f4fd6386cfa83ef54ffc6e669986800e28294a61ae6518eb5556",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81333b384f1004959502da8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么说呢――她奔跑时的身姿，真的有种让人沐浴光芒的感觉。\n好像有一种引导他人的不可思议的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbcaf18a1e7de91ecbdeb66380e173e3714821053b0a5e722ba998bd4e4e6907",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d406e8daf2ce0d7107bc786",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路",
