      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯~哈、哈……！\n保持速度，找到最合适的路线……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08bbe889bf3cefb0904559d30f2bf73501ae945cb67660d3b93994559fba4c42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
