      "source_text": "（应援……为了我而来的……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd44e87be4317fba9a07f5ffd105392a8bb94434777103f90c73fc0dbbfe5857",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
