    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba173e7bdb7516cf312c446",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说是为了克服弱点而制定的训练项目，但是内容总体上来说还是太过单调了。\n只不过是反复做同样的事情，形成肌肉记忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b97e056cda093577a8cdbfc91c5ac1ed22f85b3282bcf7370671dcd3b2a4e3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdd3a7fce4a675ff906d8dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这么短的时间内与其做许多不同的训练项目，不如集中一点更容易有收获。\n――但是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d96c1044d44e4413c96b6cc3bc8eda28823e195e29dc6ce8f9f26771a53fcbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eeaa884a07cffd5a6e7693c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路",
      "source_fingerprint": "988a071d6223b7f19ac194fb48e747cae2ebec8525c415e4d4d92ec1443cca38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
