    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51eafcad24fc174449d6e387",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊、哈……哈……\n还是失败了……腿也开始摇摇晃晃的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab167ae5ef1836361f5806b4d89e94737c4564706f98ad2cf4a8f9e8ffa8b2a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d00b0a2bcfaf0242114fc41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样的训练重复几小时也有厌倦的可能性。\n如果担当出现干劲下降的情况，就必须重新审视训练的内容了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "24b4eab1b2dd6be92fa72a2f075ba4b1c3884636ef0741a60af4d43b7d1006c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
