        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7088254f7858845eaf26af01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她充满精神，就好像是刚刚才开始训练一样。\n成田路用这样的眼神注视着我并听着建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b31d040bf0c0ed2a5ce4dd967754ad7b23367457d400ec259f206d3b58a8d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb44f0277c0a46246b29815",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路奔跑的姿态，每一步跨出的幅度都很大。\n因此能非常快速地到达她的最快速度，而且加速的持续性也很高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "078c478a74de1b3ff09a6e7059f8323c6bd8c466102381481250edef52f34a09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
