      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……嘿嘿，还是被发现了吗。对不起。\n但是，我想再做点力所能及的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ff20a6799af2bbe6bfe4c8bc1d4ec4f6bbbc234cc47e177f2ce11c1777776f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
