    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60262b85780d000144f6255f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……让选择了我的训练员高兴，\n我想要让比赛的结果是这个样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dfc12e3411e0cb1403a580fac7390b2a4925b0cc0f3ebc53167a5ca855fe609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c09b60d45c7fb42a16dece62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……其实，我很高兴。但是我不想她这样的勉强自己。\n作为训练员，才是最应该去帮助她们取得最好的结果的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab417e16b381bead632445fec814f515bcfd59eeed6773dd4cd29edfbd8e8f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
