    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60a7a454846009f3c41e526",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凭借着又长又好的双腿，如果是在长而宽的直线赛道，\n她的这个特点能被有效地发挥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b960e300d41d6f0adb0e7f5c3ebbe32f65eecdce970b2f742ccd365fffd57658",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
