    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c64909c84471b8c8e8c2245",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果在比赛里不能很好的按照情况转换跑步的姿态，苦战的场面会变多。\n比如在小弯道上，需要进行细小的步伐调整――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e273486dce44fc8baa5c3a3875f06a659073bd71539bbb5b8b477ef0ca501e4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
