    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:025a92f4ef758a154fac18bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后是如果赛场的状态不好的话，\n就会容易脚滑，导致没办法随心所欲的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b45d6cd2af693b29ce025806a326e0f681782e8f6a7fd42d4030f7fef81f4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1077/storytimeline_041077003.json",
      "json_path": [
